\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MxbrsZPo2pUQ7kNvwHPLyoV&_nc_oc=Adrx6w6ufGj65lNN1kz9mPHKOikI0-DqYijH1SY3E2oXDncrJJBOjqYstQq3XWVL1IE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT6Cz5fR95dHRyeCkjYxLmyAC2BDnvYnaJcZyrJEbXnzA&oe=6B0471F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jA5QWOfzy0wQ7kNvwF7wBLD&_nc_oc=AdqUMRccwn3iH1itOrUXd-0G6i-NiEg0nD4pe3X1TE21q59FKUdnqPza3nclSPc5f5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTB50B3MxGN1mXSyOVddaXmJySTzrE_ihfdmwyqj_AGRg&oe=6B046DF6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ARryVHIKHxkQ7kNvwGyN5ac&_nc_oc=AdqOdnW31VIj0yPuqeap9saOAqQ2dZwgFuExVGwr5MjYB2QdPvJlHYBfRq9w1tRJESQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHsSMSS2_LBcR6dP4tpcu-_KQaahITNcfpFQ5BCi1NsA&oe=6B04727E"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u